{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>下午約三時，皇崗口岸返港人流逐漸增加。現場所見，所有通道已全開，未見多人輪候的情況，亦較少見到閘機有閘門亮紅燈。保安局「口岸通」下午近5時顯示，平均輪候時間約5分鐘。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER.BUS-1630.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026psaClpOijn1792402666.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>公共交通交匯處的巴士站，多條出市區路線都有人排隊，巴士公司派職員協助。大部分上滿客後就立即開出，未見滯留上不到車的情況。</p><p><br/>有市民稱：「七、八分鐘已經可以過關，都有人，但過得很快。」<br/></p><p>蕭小姐說：「很快、很快，五分鐘左右，我怕稍後到夜晚，最後一日假期會多人。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T10:20:02.350928+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T10:57:01.931125+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T10:17:40.495436+00:00","content_hash":"9a4f11b2dc01a9ddbcc2d5f4a859cb8f2e506b6a93e6d4558e6c7a9b6f0f8b8d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}